[DISPUTE] Closed (<%= @status %>) — Gift card #<%= @gift_card.id %>
======================================================

Gift card ID:        #<%= @gift_card.id %>
Stripe dispute ID:   <%= @dispute_id %>
Amount:              <%= @amount_formatted %>
Final status:        <%= @status %>

<%= case @status
    when "won" then "We retained the funds. disputed_at flag remains set — release manually if appropriate."
    when "lost" then "Stripe debited the disputed amount. Gift card canceled via charge.refunded webhook."
    when "warning_closed" then "Pre-dispute warning closed without escalation."
    else "Outcome: #{@status}. Review manually."
    end %>

View in Stripe: https://dashboard.stripe.com/disputes/<%= @dispute_id %>
